<!-- ============ WHAT DO WE DO ============ -->
<section class="section" style="padding-bottom: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 20px;">Teamwork Cares is built around one simple belief: that businesses have a responsibility to give back. Through hands-on initiatives, local partnerships, and team-driven efforts, we work to create meaningful change in the communities where we live and work.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">Our initiatives range from direct community service and charitable giving to volunteering and cause-based partnerships, all focused on helping people. Since our founding, Teamwork Cares members around the world have dedicated their time, resources, and energy to making a tangible impact on the lives of others.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STRATEGIC INITIATIVES ============ -->
<section class="section" id="initiatives">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Strategic Initiatives</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Education, relief and community.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="init-grid">
      <div class="init-card">
        <img src="/assets/images/company/cares/initiative-education.webp" alt="Students supported by a TeamworkCares education initiative" loading="lazy">
        <div class="init-body">
          <h3>Education</h3>
          <p>We partner with local schools and youth organizations to provide students with the resources they need to show up ready to learn. From donating backpacks and school supplies to supporting lower-income schools ahead of the school year, our focus is on removing barriers so students can focus on what matters most.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="init-card">
        <img src="/assets/images/company/cares/initiative-mentorship.webp" alt="A TeamworkCares mentorship session" loading="lazy">
        <div class="init-body">
          <h3>Relief</h3>
          <p>We respond to immediate needs, both locally and globally. From assembling weekend snack bags for children facing food insecurity to donating clothing, shoes, and essentials to families in need, to providing medical supplies for communities in crisis, our team steps in wherever the need is greatest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="init-card">
        <img src="/assets/images/company/cares/initiative-community.webp" alt="TeamworkCares volunteers at a local community event" loading="lazy">
        <div class="init-body">
          <h3>Community</h3>
          <p>We stay active in the communities around our offices, organizing volunteer events, donation drives, and local partnerships that let our team roll up their sleeves and make a direct impact. If a local organization needs support, we want to be there.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PROGRAM PILLARS ============ -->
<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;" id="pillars">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Program Pillars</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Where we show up.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Eight pillars guide both our volunteering and our charitable giving, so there is always more than one way for the team to take part.</p>
    </div>

    {% set pillars = [
      ["ti-building-community", "Community & Local Impact", ["Food banks and food drives", "Homelessness support", "Community cleanups", "Local nonprofit and school partnerships"]],
      ["ti-school", "Education & Youth", ["School supply drives", "Mentoring and tutoring", "Scholarships and career readiness", "STEM and technology education"]],
      ["ti-stethoscope", "Health & Well-Being", ["Mental health awareness", "Senior support", "Hospital and nonprofit volunteering", "Blood drives and health initiatives"]],
      ["ti-leaf", "Environment & Sustainability", ["Beach, park and neighborhood cleanups", "Tree planting", "Recycling initiatives", "Conservation and sustainability education"]],
      ["ti-soup", "Hunger & Basic Needs", ["Food bank volunteering and meal packing", "Clothing and hygiene drives", "Holiday giving", "Support for families experiencing hardship"]],
      ["ti-world", "Global Communities", ["Disaster relief", "International aid organizations", "Refugee support", "Employee-led fundraising for global causes"]],
      ["ti-accessible", "Inclusion & Empowerment", ["Programs supporting people with disabilities", "Women's empowerment", "Veteran support", "Organizations promoting opportunity and accessibility"]],
      ["ti-paw", "Animals & Animal Welfare", ["Animal shelter volunteering", "Pet food and supply drives", "Adoption events", "Wildlife conservation"]]
    ] %}

    <div class="cpil-grid">
      {% for pl in pillars %}
      <div class="cpil">
        <div class="cpil-head">
          <span class="cpil-ico"><i class="ti {{ pl[0] }}"></i></span>
          <h3 class="cpil-name">{{ pl[1] }}</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="cpil-list">
          {% for item in pl[2] %}<li>{{ item }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WHAT DO WE BELIEVE IN ============ -->
<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">What We Believe In</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">What do we believe in?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mini-grid">
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-target-arrow"></i></div>
        <h3>Mission</h3>
        <p>To raise awareness on the challenges of systemic racism and supporting equality around the world. Teamwork employees use their collective skills, knowledge, and ideas to bring about a positive and impactful change through education, mentorship and community initiatives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-eye"></i></div>
        <h3>Vision</h3>
        <p>To support Black Lives Matter, local organizations, underserved communities and educational initiatives. Through these actions TeamworkCares will empower social change, drive positive community growth and take a stand against social injustice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-scale"></i></div>
        <h3>Values</h3>
        <p>TeamworkCares is driven by respect, acceptance, and accountability. We stand up for justice and equality across the world. We are committed to driving out discrimination where we find it, supporting change through our resources, and advocating for meaningful action.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FEATURED EVENT ============ -->
<section class="tm-band">
  <div class="tm-band-glow"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Featured Event</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Ukraine Awareness Month: TeamworkCares sponsors AFUMED.</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <img src="/assets/images/company/cares/afumed.webp" alt="A collage from the TeamworkCares AFUMED sponsorship in Ukraine" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border); display: block;">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">AFUMED is a charitable organization committed to providing essential medical support to Ukrainian soldiers on the front lines. Since 2022, they have supplied 160 first-aid kits and supported 53 military units. Their specialized ambulatory first-aid kits and organized roll packs, developed with military doctors, ensure quick access to vital medications. AFUMED emphasizes financial transparency and replenishes these kits upon request, making a life-saving difference. The organization relies on public support to empower and protect heroes with the necessary medical supplies.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

